    "title": "Wanted Suspect Davion Johnson Apprehended Following Public Appeal by Covington Police - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sofia Garcia-Jones ,\n1 days ago The Covington Police Department has successfully brought a manhunt to a close with the apprehension of Davion Johnson, the individual wanted on multiple charges. Earlier, the Covington Tennessee Police Department had taken to social media, hoping to amplify their search by enlisting the public's assistance. They had posted an urgent call on their Facebook page, urging anyone with information to reach out and contact the Covington Dispatch. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
